   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "12ce1c7b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    ":::\n",
    "\n",
    "## Progressive Stippling Animation\n",
    "\n",
    "This section creates a GIF showing how the stippled image looks as more points are added sequentially. We'll use the already-computed stippling points to generate frames at increments of 100 points.\n",
    "\n",
    "::: {.panel-tabset}\n",
    "\n",
    "### Python"
   ]
  },
  {
